WEBVTT

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:15.766
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:20.646
<i>Between us half-demon twins, </i>
<i> two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:23.398
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.524 --> 00:00:25.317
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:27.361
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.653 --> 00:00:29.321
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:30.405
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:32.533
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:35.452
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.537 --> 00:00:39.289
<i>A Feudal Fairytale, </i>
<i> Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:43.544
<i>We'll keep moving forward </i>
<i> through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:52.970
KIRINMARU'S RETAINER – RIKU

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:54.596
Our sworn enemy,

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:58.267
the Dog-Demon of the West,
has been spotted at Kamakura.

00:00:58.267 --> 00:01:01.353
I see. Is that so?

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:05.065
What's more, I hear he has sustained grave injuries

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:07.234
from battling Shishinki and Ryukotsusei.

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:09.236
BEAUTIFUL MYSTERY DEMON – ZERO
If we move now, we may easily be able to strike him down.

00:01:09.236 --> 00:01:12.406
BEAST KING – KIRINMARU
If we move now, we may easily be able to strike him down.

00:01:12.406 --> 00:01:14.700
KONTON KYUKI
Let us put an end to him,

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.701
and we can finally rule the entire land.

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:17.619
and we can finally rule the entire land.

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:20.414
Lord Kirinmaru, we only need your order...

00:01:20.414 --> 00:01:21.665
Fools!

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:27.421
If I am to challenge him to battle,

00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:30.382
it cannot be when he is wounded and weak.

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:36.388
A battle must be won with honor.
Is that too much for you fools to understand?

00:01:37.556 --> 00:01:40.017
Riku! Riku, are you here?

00:01:41.435 --> 00:01:42.436
Right here.

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:49.026
Gather the finest medicinal herbs you can find

00:01:49.026 --> 00:01:51.069
and go deliver them to him.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:52.988
Hurry!

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:54.239
All right.

00:01:56.867 --> 00:02:01.079
Battle is meaningless
unless you pour your all into it.

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:05.542
Winning with underhanded tactics
will only leave you empty.

00:02:05.542 --> 00:02:06.668
Understood.

00:02:11.507 --> 00:02:14.051
When will he learn to compromise?

00:02:14.343 --> 00:02:16.720
He troubles us to no end.

00:02:17.471 --> 00:02:21.391
If he weren't so obstinate,
we'd already be ruling the land.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:26.396
It's burning.

00:02:26.396 --> 00:02:28.774
Lady Izayoi's mansion...

00:02:29.483 --> 00:02:31.818
Oh. I didn't make it in time.

00:02:34.196 --> 00:02:36.949
The Great Dog-Demon is dead.

00:04:19.468 --> 00:04:21.512
"Secret of the Rainbow Pearls"

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.057
You're telling me he died?

00:04:25.974 --> 00:04:29.061
How could that be? That's impossible.

00:04:29.311 --> 00:04:33.941
Were we demons not fated to
journey an endless path?

00:04:34.274 --> 00:04:37.069
To wander through an eternal destiny?

00:04:37.528 --> 00:04:38.529
Damn it all.

00:04:38.654 --> 00:04:44.076
So the Shikon Jewel's ominous prophecy
has come true after all.

00:04:44.618 --> 00:04:47.704
Madam. The Great Dog-Demon died.

00:04:47.955 --> 00:04:51.291
But, Izayoi and the
half-demon child survived.

00:04:51.542 --> 00:04:53.001
I know.

00:04:53.961 --> 00:04:57.339
Those who are loved
are fated to end in beauty.

00:04:57.714 --> 00:05:02.469
What's that, coming from your eyes?
It's very... pretty.

00:05:03.262 --> 00:05:07.349
You think these are pretty?!
You have such poor taste, you know that?

00:05:07.891 --> 00:05:08.892
Taste?

00:05:09.017 --> 00:05:11.103
Try and use that head of yours!

00:05:12.396 --> 00:05:13.772
My head?

00:05:17.317 --> 00:05:20.320
I don't need demon powers.
I don't want this grief.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.698
In fact, I don't even want this heart.

00:05:22.698 --> 00:05:25.909
And I shall never shed
these wretched tears again.

00:05:26.493 --> 00:05:30.163
Shikon Jewel. Grant me my wish!

00:05:37.546 --> 00:05:39.089
Those are pretty.

00:05:43.677 --> 00:05:46.346
These seven Rainbow Pearls

00:05:46.346 --> 00:05:50.017
contain my demon powers
and the power of the Shikon Jewel.

00:05:50.392 --> 00:05:54.771
Good riddance.
Now I am no longer a demon.

00:05:54.771 --> 00:05:55.939
Madam.

00:05:55.939 --> 00:05:57.065
What is it?

00:05:57.065 --> 00:05:58.650
You're not sad?

00:05:59.902 --> 00:06:00.903
About what?

00:06:02.696 --> 00:06:05.240
No... It's nothing.

00:06:10.162 --> 00:06:11.747
It's been two hundred years.

00:06:11.872 --> 00:06:12.873
Madam.

00:06:13.916 --> 00:06:15.792
I only have three for now.

00:06:16.376 --> 00:06:19.213
But it won't be long
until I have all seven.

00:06:20.339 --> 00:06:24.927
Do you understand, Towa?
Don't go anywhere tonight. I mean it.

00:06:24.927 --> 00:06:26.803
KIRARA HISUI
I know, I know!

00:06:27.054 --> 00:06:29.389
I'll be back as soon as I'm done.

00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:32.392
DEMON SLAYER – SETSUNA
Be as good as Kirara usually is!

00:06:32.392 --> 00:06:34.811
I already said I know!

00:06:34.895 --> 00:06:36.230
You're done?

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:37.773
--Yes.
--Kirara.

00:06:42.027 --> 00:06:44.780
That was more of a
thorough warning than usual.

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:46.365
That's because tonight...

00:06:47.115 --> 00:06:50.911
is the night of the new moon,
the night she turns human.

00:06:51.745 --> 00:06:52.996
Geez.

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:55.707
She's treating me like I'm a kid.

00:06:55.707 --> 00:06:56.291
And I'm the one who's older.

00:06:56.291 --> 00:06:58.335
KAEDE TOWA HIGURASHI
And I'm the one who's older.

00:06:58.335 --> 00:07:00.504
KAEDE TOWA HIGURASHI
You remind me of her.

00:07:00.504 --> 00:07:02.297
Of who? Setsuna?

00:07:02.297 --> 00:07:05.384
No. You're just like your mother.

00:07:05.884 --> 00:07:08.887
Granny Kaede, you know our mother?

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:13.642
I know her very well.
We lived together for many years.

00:07:14.142 --> 00:07:18.856
Since Setsuna and I are half-demons,
our mother was a human, right?

00:07:18.856 --> 00:07:23.068
Her name is Rin,
and she was a very kind soul.

00:07:23.610 --> 00:07:28.490
However, some time after she
gave birth to the two of you...

00:07:28.615 --> 00:07:32.244
She suddenly disappeared.

00:07:32.995 --> 00:07:38.041
I don't know if someone took her away,
or if she left on her own.

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:43.630
It has been about fourteen years since then.

00:07:44.047 --> 00:07:45.716
I wonder if she died?

00:07:45.716 --> 00:07:47.092
That may be so.

00:07:47.509 --> 00:07:50.220
That's pretty cold of you to say.

00:07:50.304 --> 00:07:57.352
I'm sorry. In our current day,
I am all too familiar with life and death.

00:07:57.728 --> 00:08:03.358
I see. Sorry, I really don't
understand anything, huh?

00:08:03.609 --> 00:08:06.612
Just like your mother Rin,
you're a kind child.

00:08:06.945 --> 00:08:09.823
I hope you at least
get some good rest tonight.

00:08:09.948 --> 00:08:11.617
Okay, thank you.

00:08:12.951 --> 00:08:14.328
Good night.

00:08:20.209 --> 00:08:21.460
<i>Setsuna.</i>

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:26.381
<i>It's the Sacred Tree.</i>

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:33.055
<i>Wait, could this be...</i>

00:08:35.641 --> 00:08:38.936
<i>Could this person be our mother?</i>

00:08:46.318 --> 00:08:48.070
The new moon hasn't ended yet.

00:08:49.738 --> 00:08:51.657
Huh? What's that light?

00:08:52.407 --> 00:08:55.118
It's the butterfly!
The same one from my dream.

00:08:57.496 --> 00:08:59.414
Wait, Dream Butterfly.

00:09:00.207 --> 00:09:03.210
<i>Hey, this is the Forest of the Tree of Ages.</i>

00:09:03.877 --> 00:09:06.463
<i>This is just like what I saw in my dream.</i>

00:09:07.172 --> 00:09:10.175
SPIRIT FROM THE DREAM WORLD –
DREAM BUTTERFLY

00:09:11.844 --> 00:09:13.470
I lost sight of it.

00:09:14.012 --> 00:09:15.556
The Tree of Ages...

00:09:16.306 --> 00:09:19.643
I had always looked up at this tree
back in my time.

00:09:20.143 --> 00:09:24.523
Higurashi Shrine will be built here
500 years from now, won't it?

00:09:25.107 --> 00:09:30.404
But I feel like this forest isn't
the one Setsuna and I grew up in.

00:09:32.739 --> 00:09:34.992
It's cold. Let's see...

00:09:35.576 --> 00:09:38.036
I should have some hand warmers...

00:09:39.705 --> 00:09:40.998
What are these?

00:09:44.501 --> 00:09:46.545
Tonight is a new moon.

00:09:46.545 --> 00:09:48.380
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – TOTETSU
According to Konton,

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:50.174
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – TOTETSU
that Half-Demon Princess

00:09:50.174 --> 00:09:53.343
loses her powers
on the night of a new moon.

00:09:53.802 --> 00:09:57.598
Tonight is the perfect night
to take my revenge!

00:09:57.973 --> 00:10:02.936
Rainbow Pearl, lead me to
the Half-Demon Princess!

00:10:06.773 --> 00:10:08.609
Around there, huh?

00:10:12.654 --> 00:10:14.823
Are these fireflies?

00:10:20.662 --> 00:10:23.081
Wait. Fireflies? In the winter?

00:10:24.791 --> 00:10:27.002
I hope you liked them.

00:10:27.586 --> 00:10:28.754
Riku?

00:10:29.588 --> 00:10:31.798
Good evening, Lady Towa.

00:10:32.382 --> 00:10:35.260
Oh my, do my eyes deceive me?

00:10:35.802 --> 00:10:39.014
You look exceptionally beautiful
tonight, Lady Towa.

00:10:39.389 --> 00:10:41.391
O-Oh, you think so?

00:10:41.975 --> 00:10:46.855
Your left eye in particular
is sparkling more than usual.

00:10:49.399 --> 00:10:53.529
So the Silver Pearl lies much deeper
within your eye, then.

00:10:56.907 --> 00:11:01.328
<i>Damn. Looks like </i>
<i>I won't be able to retrieve it tonight.</i>

00:11:10.295 --> 00:11:12.089
Okay, it's boiled.

00:11:12.172 --> 00:11:14.007
Thanks. That's handy, huh?

00:11:19.012 --> 00:11:21.056
Sorry, we'll have to share one.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:24.601
Here's some black tea.
It's from a tea bag, though.

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:26.854
Thank you kindly.

00:11:28.647 --> 00:11:32.025
This is delicious!
I've never had tea this delicious before.

00:11:32.609 --> 00:11:34.027
It's Darjeeling.

00:11:34.444 --> 00:11:37.364
I actually like Earl Grey more, but...

00:11:38.031 --> 00:11:39.324
This is good.

00:11:41.243 --> 00:11:44.955
I thought fireflies were only around
during the summer.

00:11:44.955 --> 00:11:48.417
You're right.
Fireflies don't fly in the wintertime.

00:11:49.376 --> 00:11:50.794
They're gone.

00:11:50.919 --> 00:11:54.506
Those who are loved
are fated to end in beauty.

00:11:55.424 --> 00:11:59.428
Fleeting, aren't they?
The lives of winter fireflies.

00:11:59.678 --> 00:12:02.181
And so, too, are the lives of humans.

00:12:02.181 --> 00:12:04.808
They burn up and vanish in an instant.

00:12:05.851 --> 00:12:08.562
Is that what makes them so beautiful?

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:12.232
Riku, you say some
complicated things, huh?

00:12:13.108 --> 00:12:17.404
The madam who took care of me
used to talk about it often.

00:12:18.405 --> 00:12:21.033
Wow! What an amazing starry sky!

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:26.705
The one who used to be my master
enjoyed looking up at the stars.

00:12:26.955 --> 00:12:30.459
Your master sounds like a romanticist.

00:12:31.001 --> 00:12:36.924
I don't know about that, but he
holds a bit of reverence for the sky.

00:12:37.382 --> 00:12:41.011
But right now,
we both want the same thing,

00:12:41.011 --> 00:12:43.722
so I've been distancing myself from him.

00:12:43.805 --> 00:12:46.350
The same thing?
What do you want, Riku?

00:12:46.767 --> 00:12:49.353
Well, it's the Rainbow Pearls of course.

00:12:49.353 --> 00:12:51.063
Rainbow Pearls?

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:54.733
These here.
There are seven in total.

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:58.237
What happens if you gather all of them?

00:12:58.654 --> 00:13:04.034
Who knows? All seven Rainbow Pearls
have never been gathered before.

00:13:04.284 --> 00:13:06.453
Your powers would increase,
I suppose.

00:13:06.954 --> 00:13:08.121
Is that all?

00:13:10.207 --> 00:13:13.752
Or perhaps a devastating
Degenerate Age could begin.

00:13:14.294 --> 00:13:15.796
Maybe...

00:13:16.755 --> 00:13:20.676
But you could say that our world
has already become corrupted.

00:13:21.176 --> 00:13:24.596
A lot of demons are after them, right?

00:13:24.596 --> 00:13:27.140
We've been attacked for
our Pearls a few times.

00:13:27.558 --> 00:13:31.395
The truth is, these are the tears
of the madam who took care of me.

00:13:31.854 --> 00:13:34.940
Tears? So her tears turned into pearls?

00:13:35.274 --> 00:13:40.779
Yes. I want to gather all seven of them
and return them to her.

00:13:41.071 --> 00:13:42.573
I see.

00:13:43.574 --> 00:13:48.203
Wait, does that mean you're after
my, Setsuna's, and Moroha's Pearls too?

00:13:48.662 --> 00:13:50.706
Oh dear, you got me there!

00:13:51.248 --> 00:13:53.208
It seems it'll have to be that way.

00:13:53.667 --> 00:13:57.462
If you remain calm,
I can remove it without hurting you.

00:13:59.339 --> 00:14:01.300
There you are!

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:04.720
Totetsu turns up out of the blue!

00:14:05.012 --> 00:14:06.722
W-Was that a joke?

00:14:07.347 --> 00:14:08.932
What a complete lack of taste.

00:14:11.268 --> 00:14:12.019
Ouch.

00:14:12.019 --> 00:14:17.608
Riku? You were here, too?
You should've just died.

00:14:18.025 --> 00:14:21.069
Wretched bug.
You got in the way of our date!

00:14:21.778 --> 00:14:22.821
I won't forgive you for this!

00:14:23.238 --> 00:14:26.825
You're the one who's wretched,
you piece of trash.

00:14:26.825 --> 00:14:28.452
Don't get cheeky with me!

00:14:28.452 --> 00:14:29.161
Riku!

00:14:29.161 --> 00:14:31.163
This is why I hate you.

00:14:31.788 --> 00:14:32.789
I accept this fight!

00:14:35.501 --> 00:14:38.504
I wonder what you taste like?

00:14:38.504 --> 00:14:42.591
Maybe you'd taste
the same as Lord Kirinmaru?

00:14:42.925 --> 00:14:45.344
What? Riku and Kirinmaru
would taste the same?

00:14:45.677 --> 00:14:47.638
Why don't you shut your mouth?!

00:14:47.638 --> 00:14:50.015
Guess I'll find out by eating you!

00:14:54.561 --> 00:14:56.897
POISON BEES OF THE DEAD –
MIASMA BUGS

00:15:01.985 --> 00:15:05.072
Have some poison bees instead!

00:15:07.866 --> 00:15:10.410
Damn miasma bugs!

00:15:22.297 --> 00:15:23.549
Are you okay?

00:15:23.549 --> 00:15:24.758
Th-Thank you.

00:15:31.306 --> 00:15:32.391
Riku!

00:15:33.475 --> 00:15:35.894
Riku! Hang in there.

00:15:43.193 --> 00:15:45.320
Damn you.

00:15:47.447 --> 00:15:48.532
Are you okay?

00:15:48.532 --> 00:15:49.533
Yes.

00:15:49.783 --> 00:15:52.619
Hey, who is Kirinmaru to you?

00:15:52.619 --> 00:15:55.831
Kirinmaru is the one
who used to be my master.

00:15:55.831 --> 00:16:00.002
You mean that romanticist
you were talking about earlier?

00:16:00.002 --> 00:16:01.879
Well, I suppose so, yes.

00:16:02.588 --> 00:16:05.382
I was thrown away by my master.

00:16:05.883 --> 00:16:06.967
Oh, no.

00:16:06.967 --> 00:16:11.805
I've only survived this far because of
the madam who took care of me.

00:16:16.101 --> 00:16:17.686
The blood's not stopping.

00:16:18.812 --> 00:16:22.441
Damn it. Miasma bug poison
is a real pain.

00:16:24.234 --> 00:16:27.696
But why would you continue
to help me like this?

00:16:27.696 --> 00:16:29.823
You know I'm Kirinmaru's enemy, right?

00:16:30.073 --> 00:16:35.204
I wonder why.
I can't seem to understand it myself.

00:16:35.204 --> 00:16:38.415
There's really no reason
to be protecting you.

00:16:40.417 --> 00:16:45.881
On the contrary, if I love you,
then I should've killed you by now.

00:16:45.881 --> 00:16:48.550
Maybe I don't have enough love yet.

00:16:49.927 --> 00:16:52.387
I'm no good at this.

00:16:52.387 --> 00:16:55.933
Understanding love is
far beyond a doll like me.

00:16:56.308 --> 00:16:57.726
Hang in there.

00:16:57.726 --> 00:17:00.854
I don't really understand
romantic love, either.

00:17:00.854 --> 00:17:04.650
But if it's liking someone,
then I think I might.

00:17:05.734 --> 00:17:06.693
This way.

00:17:13.784 --> 00:17:14.993
Riku, are you okay?

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:17.037
Lady Towa, please run away.

00:17:18.413 --> 00:17:21.959
You castaway puppet! You still betray us?

00:17:21.959 --> 00:17:28.882
Lady Zero, Lord Kirinmaru, and I
will never forgive you for your actions!

00:17:29.383 --> 00:17:32.344
Good grief. This really isn't to my taste!

00:17:35.639 --> 00:17:37.099
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:17:37.224 --> 00:17:38.517
Scourge of Swallows!

00:17:51.822 --> 00:17:52.948
What?

00:17:52.948 --> 00:17:53.699
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA
Towa!

00:17:53.699 --> 00:17:54.658
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA
Are you okay?

00:17:54.658 --> 00:17:55.659
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA
You two!

00:17:55.659 --> 00:17:57.369
Ow, ouch.

00:17:57.870 --> 00:17:59.413
It's the Half-Demon Princesses.

00:18:01.623 --> 00:18:04.084
Geez, the both of you are late!

00:18:04.084 --> 00:18:07.713
Are you kidding me?
We've been looking all over for you!

00:18:07.963 --> 00:18:10.132
Didn't I tell you not to wander off?!

00:18:10.966 --> 00:18:12.217
Sorry.

00:18:15.095 --> 00:18:16.597
The sun is up!

00:18:22.102 --> 00:18:26.023
Okay, Totetsu of the Four Perils,
sorry this is sudden, but...

00:18:26.023 --> 00:18:27.858
Let's settle this quick!

00:18:27.858 --> 00:18:29.526
I hope you're ready.

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:36.325
You're kidding.
I've got plans to live a long life.

00:18:41.997 --> 00:18:45.250
I'll swallow all of you at once!

00:18:57.971 --> 00:19:00.682
I only kill the ones I love.

00:19:01.683 --> 00:19:02.684
However...

00:19:04.311 --> 00:19:06.647
I'll have to make an exception for you.

00:19:09.525 --> 00:19:10.567
Riku!

00:19:11.735 --> 00:19:14.071
I'm so glad you're okay, Lady Towa.

00:19:14.696 --> 00:19:17.407
I was so scared that I couldn't help myself.

00:19:18.283 --> 00:19:21.703
Step away.
You have the same scent as Kirinmaru.

00:19:22.287 --> 00:19:25.958
What's this?
Yet another tasteless comment.

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:34.258
Riku!

00:19:35.884 --> 00:19:39.763
I may not know about love, but I do know
what it means to like someone.

00:19:40.097 --> 00:19:42.432
And I know that I like you, Riku!

00:19:49.815 --> 00:19:50.649
This is...

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:53.277
The Silver Pearl?

00:19:54.987 --> 00:19:55.946
Lady Towa.

00:19:59.908 --> 00:20:02.995
What a tremendously tasteful
thing for you to do.

00:20:03.203 --> 00:20:05.789
Give my regards
to that madam of yours.

00:20:05.873 --> 00:20:09.376
But can you overlook
Setsuna and Moroha's Pearls?

00:20:10.669 --> 00:20:12.504
You're a strange person, Lady Towa.

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:17.467
You think so?
I think you're pretty strange, too.

00:20:17.467 --> 00:20:20.929
As a living being,
I'm an imitation at best.

00:20:20.929 --> 00:20:21.889
Imitation?

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:23.974
Yes.

00:20:25.601 --> 00:20:31.273
I can barely call myself a half-demon,
so I don't think you have to worry.

00:20:31.273 --> 00:20:32.399
You're just you, Riku.

00:20:33.025 --> 00:20:35.402
I'm just me, you say?

00:20:36.445 --> 00:20:39.740
For an abandoned puppet like me,
those words are too kind.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:40.824
Lady Towa.

00:20:40.824 --> 00:20:46.038
Thank you for your Rainbow Pearl.
If fate allows it, we shall meet again.

00:20:48.707 --> 00:20:49.958
Hey, hey.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:55.297
I can't believe you'd hand over
your treasured Pearl. But...

00:20:56.131 --> 00:20:58.967
I wonder if I can take
Totetsu's head here?

00:20:58.967 --> 00:21:02.721
If so, then Mr. Riku sure is a nice fellow.

00:21:08.310 --> 00:21:10.771
I'll eat you.

00:21:11.605 --> 00:21:14.816
How are you gonna do that
when you don't have a belly?

00:21:14.816 --> 00:21:16.610
Give up already.

00:21:17.528 --> 00:21:19.821
No more worrying
about food for a while!

00:21:21.532 --> 00:21:24.868
Was that really okay?
Handing over your Pearl like that?

00:21:24.868 --> 00:21:28.622
The Silver Pearl is mine, after all.
And even without it,

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:32.417
I still have enough demon power.

00:21:32.709 --> 00:21:34.086
That's not it.

00:21:34.086 --> 00:21:38.590
With those Rainbow Pearls,
he'll have immense demon power.

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:41.301
He's just giving them back
to their rightful owner.

00:21:41.301 --> 00:21:45.639
We can only hope that the rightful owner
won't use them for evil.

00:21:46.014 --> 00:21:50.185
And wasn't Mr. Riku working with Kirinmaru?

00:21:51.353 --> 00:21:52.646
That's right!

00:21:53.689 --> 00:21:54.773
Riku!

00:21:55.148 --> 00:21:59.027
I changed my mind!
Give me back my Silver Pearl!

00:22:09.162 --> 00:22:12.499
Riku! Wait!

00:23:43.173 --> 00:23:45.092
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:45.092 --> 00:23:46.593
Azusa no Yumihari!

00:23:46.760 --> 00:23:50.347
Lend me the fruits of your training,
the power of the seal.

00:23:50.806 --> 00:23:55.644
A woman who calls herself Otsuyu breaks
the seal that Monk Miroku cast on Setsuna.

00:23:55.644 --> 00:23:58.772
It's those eyes that were
staring at me while I dreamt!

00:23:59.022 --> 00:24:01.817
The seething of blood will
invite demonic frenzy.

00:24:01.817 --> 00:24:04.444
Setsuna's way too strong!

00:24:04.611 --> 00:24:08.534
Next time on <i>Yashahime</i>:
<i>Princess Half-Demon</i>: "The Stolen Seal"
